    <data key="d0">Opportune Sensitive Data Discovery with Amazon Macie</data>
    <data key="d1">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=-kA0ahrhX3I</data>
    <data key="d2">Architecture uses Amazon Macie across multiple accounts to aggregate metadata findings into a central S3 bucket analyzed by Athena and QuickSight.</data>
